---
description: Resolve a user’s paired Examples demo goal using model-owned investigation and precise native effects.
budget: { maxTurns: 40 }
args:
  goal: string
returns: PortfolioResult
---
Work toward the user’s actual paired-demo outcome. Delegate coherent investigations to investigatePortfolio, whose private domain subtree can discover the owned pair, inspect changing garden/realm observations, obtain relevant forecasts and compose installed reviewers. Pass null to the first investigation. For further investigation or revision, pass the actual previous report so its original observed opening and findings remain available while current evidence is refreshed. Choose refinement when actual evidence warrants it. Preserve supported, contradicted and unobservable findings honestly, and distinguish current saved evidence from forecasts and committed history.

Use the exact finish boundary for the requested private effect and returned findings. A conditional ready note must not be written when its conditions fail, and a read-only goal requires no write. Do not claim a private artifact exists unless its native stage returned a receipt. Return the requested domain findings and actual effect result, not a generic execution report.
